        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>EZGrab 20 Inch Simplistic Designer Grab Bar</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFrom the EZGrab Elegance Series this stylish simplistic designer 20\" long x 1-1/4\" diameter contemporary grab bar is made from tough stainless steel. For residential and commercial use, available in <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned to exceed 250 lbs of load force when properly installed into wall studs. Concealed screw mounting for a clean installation. Packaged with six (6) #12 x 1-3/4\" stainless steel screws and plastic anchors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for EZGrab 20 Inch Simplistic Designer Grab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 21-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length, Center to Center Mounting: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Tube Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Finish:<b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/grab-bars\">Grab Bars</a>.</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
